        <mxCell id="ds" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d6f5d6;strokeColor=#4a9a4a;" value="◄输入← .npz(path_list.json) + idx&#xa;►输出→ batch tuple: ego_current[10] ego_future[80,3]&#xa;  neighbor_past[32,21,11] neighbor_future[10,80,3]&#xa;  lanes[70,20,12] route_lanes[25,20,12] static[5,10]&#xa;DiffusionPlannerData.__getitem__:17&#xa;⚠predicted_neighbor_num=10（仅 dataset 兼容，HDP 不预测邻居）" vertex="1">
