        <mxCell id="te" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d6f5d6;strokeColor=#4a9a4a;" value="◄输入← batch tuple + model/ema/opt/args&#xa;►输出→ diffusion_loss_func 调用&#xa;train_epoch:11&#xa;inputs.to(device) → aug(if) → heading→cos/sin(ego_future[B,80,3]→[B,80,4])&#xa;→ ObservationNormalizer → diffusion_loss_func(model, inputs, sde, futures, state_normalizer, loss, model_type, supervision_type)" vertex="1">
