        <mxCell id="bg_loss" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ece1f7;strokeColor=#9b7cc7;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" value="loss.py  (diffusion_loss_func:9 — HDP 核心：速度 GT + 4目标 transform + 混合损失)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="350" width="1640" x="30" y="410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="loss" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3eafa;strokeColor=#7a4fb0;" value="◄输入← (model, inputs, sde, futures=(ego_future[B,80,4],), state_normalizer, loss, model_type, supervision_type)&#xa;►输出→ loss dict{ego_planning_loss, ego_planning_hybrid_loss}(scalars)&#xa;diffusion_loss_func:9 (loss.py)&#xa;① GT 构造: ego_future_vel = diff(zero_pad ⊕ ego_future):25 → [B,80,4](Δx,Δy,cos,sin)&#xa;   all_gt = norm(ego_future_vel):30 → [B,80,4]（⚠无 anchor 帧，ego-only！）&#xa;② 加噪: t=rand[B], z=randn[B,80,4] → sde.marginal_prob(all_gt,t):35 → mean,std&#xa;   xT = mean + std*z → [B,80,4]&#xa;③ 4目标: v = sde.transform(&#39;noise-&gt;v&#39;,z,t,xT):40（构造 v 目标）&#xa;④ model(merged_inputs) → score[B,80,4]&#xa;⑤ score = sde.transform(f&#39;{model_type}-&gt;{supervision_type}&#39;, score, t, xT):58（转监督空间）&#xa;⑥ dpm_loss = sum((score - all_gt)**2):63（x_start 分支）→ ego_planning_loss:68" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="500" x="60" y="460" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hl" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3eafa;strokeColor=#7a4fb0;" value="◄输入← score[B,80,4] + t + xT + sde + ego_future[B,80,4] + state_normalizer&#xa;►输出→ ego_planning_hybrid_loss (scalar)&#xa;混合损失（loss.py:74-77）:&#xa;  pred_v = sde.transform(f&#39;{model_type}-&gt;x_start&#39;, score, t, xT):74 → [B,80,4](速度)&#xa;  pred_v = norm.inverse(pred_v)（反归一化）&#xa;  pred_x = detached_integral(pred_v[...,:2], W=10):76 → [B,80,2](位置，分离积分)&#xa;  loss = sum((pred_x - ego_future[...,:2])**2):77 → scalar&#xa;⚠ traj_kinematics.py:3 detached_integral（HDP 新文件）" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="400" x="610" y="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="total" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3eafa;strokeColor=#7a4fb0;" value="◄输入← ego_planning_loss + ego_planning_hybrid_loss&#xa;►输出→ loss[&#39;loss&#39;] (scalar)&#xa;总损失（train_epoch:105）:&#xa;  loss = ego_planning_loss + 0.01 * ego_planning_hybrid_loss&#xa;⚠ ω=planning_hybrid_loss=0.01&#xa;⚠ 无 neighbor_prediction_loss（HDP 删了）" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="360" x="1130" y="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
